OL,3,GNEWSA'Protect green space at Sheffield
OL,4,ASki Village site'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,800 people have signed a
OL,7,Fpetition asking Sheffield City Council
OL,8,Fto protect green space during
OL,9,Fredevelopment of the city's former ski
OL,10,Fvillage, a campaign group has said.
OL,12,FNew Zealand-based Skyline Enterprises
OL,13,Fwants to build a downhill karting luge
OL,14,Fride, family playground, zipline and
OL,15,Fsurfing experience at Parkwood Springs,
OL,16,Fnorth of Sheffield city centre.
OL,18,FMembers of Protect Parkwood Springs are
OL,19,Fconcerned that green space used by
OL,20,Flocal residents will be lost as a
OL,21,Fresult of the works.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
